  <exercise number="381" has_solution="true">
    <problem>
      <p>First derivative of $$y = x\mspace{2mu}\text{ln}\mspace{2mu}(x)\mspace{2mu}\text{cos}\mspace{2mu} x$$</p>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <p>$$\text{cos}\mspace{2mu} x \cdot \left( {\text{ln}\mspace{2mu} x + 1} \right) - x\mspace{2mu}\text{ln}\mspace{2mu}(x)\mspace{2mu}\text{sin}\mspace{2mu} x$$</p>
